{"text":"A second concern is demographic shifts. And it seems quite apropos that we're having this conversation today, but specifically the point about demographics, because according to the United Nations, November 12th, which was Saturday, was the first moment in which I recorded, the records are showing that we have surpassed eight billion people on the planet. But perhaps that is not the most interesting thing in their forecasts and their estimates. They believe also that November 12th was the moment in which India surpassed China as the largest economy by population in the world. Of course, the consequences for immigration, disorderly immigration in particular, but also considerations around supply and demand of natural resources, concerns about the quality and quantity of the world's population and access to resources, given climate change, all of these things I'll detail in a moment. But nevertheless, the sheer size of the world's population continuing to grow at a pace remains an issue of great concern.","words":[{"text":"A","start":0.52,"end":0.84},{"text":"second","start":0.84,"end":1.28},{"text":"concern","start":1.28,"end":1.94},{"text":"is","start":1.94,"end":2.32},{"text":"demographic","start":2.32,"end":2.84},{"text":"shifts","start":2.84,"end":3.52,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":4.24,"end":4.24},{"text":"it","start":4.24,"end":4.38},{"text":"seems","start":4.38,"end":4.72},{"text":"quite","start":4.72,"end":5.1},{"text":"apropos","start":5.1,"end":5.7},{"text":"that","start":5.7,"end":5.9},{"text":"we're","start":5.9,"end":6.1},{"text":"having","start":6.1,"end":6.4},{"text":"this","start":6.4,"end":6.94},{"text":"conversation","start":6.94,"end":7.58},{"text":"today","start":7.58,"end":8.16,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":8.26,"end":8.42},{"text":"specifically","start":8.42,"end":8.96},{"text":"the","start":8.96,"end":9.24},{"text":"point","start":9.24,"end":9.5},{"text":"about","start":9.5,"end":9.78},{"text":"demographics","start":9.78,"end